request.description:
Runs the full pipeline (preprocess -> detect -> OCR -> extract -> font analysis -> rule engine -> report) and returns:
{
  product_id, status, processed_at,
  declarations: { <field>: { present, value, confidence, bbox, source_image_index } },
  font_analysis: [ { field, measured_height_mm, required_min_mm, compliant } ],
  violations: [ { rule_ref, field, issue, severity } ],
  overall_compliance_status: "COMPLIANT" | "NON COMPLIANT",
  confidence_flags: { needs_manual_review, low_confidence_fields }
}

First call is slow (~50s) while EasyOCR loads its model; later calls ~10-20s. 400 if the file isn't an image; 500 on a processing error.
